    "GroupSerial" : 30946,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Come to hear the rest of our last talk, have you?\r\n—I see. Then let us speak at the Royal Family\r\nMausoleum this time.\r\nLast time, fighting alongside you...\r\n...proved more pleasant than anticipated.",
        "Jp" : "この前の話の続きを聞きにきたのかい\r\n――そうだな、では今度は《王家の墓》で話をしよう\r\n前回、君と共に戦ったのは\r\n思いのほか楽しかったからね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790249,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Skills honed by generations of High Sceptres...\r\n'Twould be a waste to let them go dull.\r\nFirst time in a long while I've thought as much.",
        "Jp" : "歴代のハイセプターたちによって磨かれた技\r\nこのまま鈍らせるのも勿体ない\r\n久しぶりにそう思えたんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790250,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Good. The Royal Family Mausoleum, then. I'll make\r\nlight preparations and be thence anon.",
        "Jp" : "いいね、《王家の墓》だ\r\n私も軽く準備をしたら\r\nすぐに向かうよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 794890,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30947,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Let us speak at the Royal Family\r\nMausoleum this time.\r\nWell... deem it a pilgrimage through memories.\r\nThink of it as keeping an old woman company.\r\nI shall be there anon, once I've made ready.",
        "Jp" : "今回は《王家の墓》で話をしよう\r\nまぁ、思い出巡りの旅に\r\n付き合うと思ってくれ\r\n私も軽く準備をしたらすぐに向かうよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790251,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30948,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hm? Think naught of it — I've only\r\njust arrived myself.\r\nCome then, let's be off!\r\n... There's an ill presence from the small room\r\njust ahead. No room for carelessness.",
        "Jp" : "ん？　気にしないで、私も今来たところさ\r\nでは行くとしようか！\r\n――このすぐ先にある小部屋から\r\n不穏な気配がするな、油断は禁物だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790252,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30949,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, 'twas good exercise at least.\r\nEven so... that the Royal Family Mausoleum should\r\nbe so overrun with monsters— Short on guards\r\nthough they may be, 'tis unforgivable.",
        "Jp" : "まぁ、いい運動にはなったか\r\nそれにしても、王家の墓ともあろう場に\r\nこんなにも魔物がのさばっているとは――\r\n警備に回す人員が不足しているとはいえ、許せないな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790253,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "—Ah, you wanted to hear of Queen Cress and\r\nthe ring, did you not?",
        "Jp" : "――ああ、クレス様と指輪の話を\r\n聞きたがっていたのだったね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790254,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Queen Cress believed that should the lost ring\r\nreturn to the royal house, its power would bring\r\nAcre Selund yet greater prosperity.",
        "Jp" : "クレス様は、失われた指輪が王家の元に戻れば\r\nその力によってアッカーシェランの一層の繁栄に\r\n繋がるとお考えだったようだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 795156,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "We wondered if it might not lie entombed\r\nalongside the kings of old— the two of us\r\nsearched every corner of this Royal Family\r\nMausoleum, yet the ring was ne'er found...",
        "Jp" : "歴代の王たちと共に葬られてはいないかと\r\n二人でこの《王家の墓》の隅々まで探したが\r\n指輪は見つからずじまい――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 795157,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Whenever the chance arose, we'd set off on\r\njourneys to find the ring, yet 'twas was never\r\nfound, and the days wore on...\r\nThe royal children were born— and Queen\r\nCress became a Dragon.",
        "Jp" : "折りを見ては指輪探しの旅に出かけたものの\r\n指輪は見つからぬまま、日々は過ぎ去り――\r\n御子たちが生まれ――\r\nそしてクレス様は竜となられた"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 795158,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Twas a Dragon young and beautiful, flame's power\r\nshimmering from within.\r\nAt that dazzling form, I held the conviction —\r\nAcre Selund's prosperity was\r\nassured, now and evermore.",
        "Jp" : "内から炎の力が煌めくような\r\n若くも美しい竜だった\r\nまばゆいほどのその御姿に、これからも\r\nアッカーシェランの繁栄は約束されたと確信したものだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 795159,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : ".......",
        "Jp" : "――――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 795160,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hehe, I can’t believe I’ve been rambling on like\r\nthis— I guess I’m getting old, too.\r\nLet’s call it a day for now.\r\nWhy don’t you come over to that\r\nhovel for a cup of tea?",
        "Jp" : "ふふ、こんな長話をするなんて\r\n私も歳をとったのかもね\r\n今回はここまでにしよう\r\nあのあばら屋でお茶でも飲んでいかないか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 795161,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30950,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "We'll stop here for today.\r\nWill you not stay for tea at my humble abode?\r\nAs it happens... I have the finest tea leaves,\r\npicked by my own hand.",
        "Jp" : "今回はここまでにしよう\r\n我があばら屋でお茶でも飲んでいかないか？\r\n今ならなんと――私自ら手摘みした\r\n最高級の茶葉がある"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790255,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "A self-sufficient life... 'tis\r\nsurprisingly enjoyable.\r\nThe pity is... there's no one to share it with.\r\nYou'll keep me company today, will you not?",
        "Jp" : "自給自足の生活も案外楽しいものさ\r\n惜しむらくはそれを一緒に楽しみたい相手が\r\n居ないことかな\r\n今日は付き合ってくれるね？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 795163,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30951,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Though the ring was ne'er found, I held\r\nconviction in Acre Selund's prosperity— But 'twas\r\nsoon after... the Demon Army attacked.",
        "Jp" : "指輪が見つからずとも\r\nアッカーシェランの繁栄を確信していた――\r\nしかし、それからすぐのことだ\r\n魔軍の襲撃があったのは"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790260,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I fear I cannot bring myself to\r\nspeak further just yet.\r\nForgive me, but let us leave it for another time.\r\nNow then, I shall prepare tea.\r\nTell me, what manner of sweetmeats do you favor?",
        "Jp" : "ここから先は、すぐには話す気になれない\r\n悪いけど、また今度にしよう\r\nさぁ、お茶の準備をするが\r\n君、茶菓子はどんなものがお好みかな？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 795162,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
